@startuml FRQ-DRV-16.2-class
' Klasni model drivera i helpera pretvorbe.
' Gledište: struktura (izvedba). Publika: implementator, tester.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor su FRQ-DRV-16.2 §1, §5–§6, core IDriver,
' concrete/driver.py, concrete/serialisation.py i kod blackwattle drivers/sdr.py
' (usklađeno 2026-09-11). DriverSDR po konvenciji NFRQ-ORG-02; ostala imena provizorna.
' Format uzorka je vrijednost ove domene (SampleFormat), ne član FileType-a: parser
' služi samo ovom driveru (NFRQ-ORG-01), pa tvornica parsera nije uključena.
title FRQ-DRV-16.2 — DriverSDR class model

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "core · existing" #EEEEEE {
  interface IDriver {
    +load() : None
    +close() : None
    +read(uri: str, **kwargs) : Any
    +write(uri: str, **kwargs) : Any
    {static} +metadata() : Any
  }
}

package "concrete · existing" #F4F4F4 {
  abstract class GenericDriver {
    +state : DriverState
    +ensure_live() : None
    +ensure_unloaded() : None
  }
  class DriverMetadata <<dataclass>> {
    +name : str
    +version : str
    +protocol : str
    +capabilities : list[str]
  }
  class DriverException
  abstract class GenericParser {
    {abstract} +deserialise(reader: BinaryIO, **kwargs) : Content
  }
}

class SDRConnection <<see FRQ-CON-16.1-class>>
enum SampleFormat <<see FRQ-CON-16.1-class>>

class DriverSDR {
  {static} +ALLOWED : list[str]
  {static} +BLOCK_SIZE : int = 131072
  {static} +SETTLE_BLOCKS : int = 1
  +effective : SDREffective | None
  +lost_total : int | None
  +load() : None
  +close() : None
  +read(uri: str, **kwargs) : Generator[SDRSampleBlock]
  +write(uri: str, **kwargs) : never returns
  {static} +metadata() : DriverMetadata
}

class IQSampleParser <<helper>> {
  {static} +ALLOWED : format, full_scale
  +deserialise(reader: BinaryIO, **kwargs) : ndarray[complex64]
}

class IQSampleFormatter <<phase 2>>

class SDRSampleBlock <<value>> {
  +samples : ndarray
  +sequence_no : int
  +started_at : datetime
  +sample_count : int
  +effective_rate : float
  +center_freq : float
  +format : str
  +full_scale : float
  +lost_before : int | None
  +description() : dict
}

class DriverSDRError
class SDRTransmitNotSupported
class SDRDeviceLost

IDriver <|.. GenericDriver
GenericDriver <|-- DriverSDR
GenericParser <|-- IQSampleParser
DriverSDR --> SDRConnection : connection_manager\n+ connection_name
DriverSDR *-- IQSampleParser : format and full scale\nfrom the profile
IQSampleParser ..> SampleFormat
DriverSDR ..> SDRSampleBlock : yields
DriverSDR ..> DriverMetadata
DriverException <|-- DriverSDRError
DriverSDRError <|-- SDRTransmitNotSupported
DriverSDRError <|-- SDRDeviceLost

note right of DriverSDR
  <b>ALLOWED</b>: connection_name, connection_manager,
  block_size, settle_blocks
  ----
  <b>read</b> is one implementation for every family
  (BR-13): the profile gives format and full scale,
  the connection gives the schedule; retuning drops
  settle_blocks blocks — the PLL lock is not
  observable through the host library.
  ----
  <b>write</b> fails by <b>type</b>: SDRTransmitNotSupported,
  on every family today (NFRQ-SEC-07 c.1).
end note

note bottom of SDRSampleBlock
  lost_before is None when the mechanism cannot
  see losses (RTL synchronous reads): reported as
  unmeasured, never as zero (BR-07).
  description() carries everything but the samples
  (NFRQ-SEC-06).
end note

note bottom of IQSampleFormatter
  Arrives with a family that transmits,
  with the authorisation check and the
  overrun threshold.
end note
@enduml
